@title
Integer Arithmetic

@flags
wrapper show_report version=3 id=a0000003-0003-0003-0003-000000000003

@prompt
Hazel supports arithmetic on integers using the operators:
- `+` addition
- `-` subtraction
- `*` multiplication
- `/` integer division

## Task

The editor below contains `2 +` with a hole after the `+`. Complete the expression by typing `2` to make `2 + 2`. It should evaluate to `4`.

@hint
Complete `2 + ⬣` by typing `2`

@reference
### Integer Operators
- `2 + 3` — addition
- `5 - 1` — subtraction
- `4 * 3` — multiplication
- `10 / 3` — integer division

@hints
Type `2` after the `+` to complete the expression.

